values ('morning-2', 'azkar', 'morning', 'Surah Al-Ikhlas in the morning', 'بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ
ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ
لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ
وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ', 'Qul huwallahu ahad. Allahus samad. Lam yalid wa lam yulad. Wa lam yakun lahu kufuwan ahad.', 'Say: He is Allah, the One. He is the Eternal Refuge. He does not have children, and He was not born. No one is equal to Him.', 'کہو: اللہ ایک ہے۔ وہ بے نیاز ہے۔ نہ اس کی اولاد ہے نہ وہ کسی کی اولاد ہے۔ کوئی اس کے برابر نہیں۔', null, null, 'Quran 112:1-4. Arabic, Saheeh International English, and Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry Urdu were copied from api.alquran.cloud on 2026-10-20. Compare them with a printed mushaf before approval. The basmala at the start is included because that API edition returns it with the first ayah. A hadith teaches reciting it three times in the morning; confirm the hadith number before approval.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, null, 3, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
