مِنَ ٱلْجِنَّةِ وَٱلنَّاسِ', 'Qul a''udhu birabbin nas, malikin nas, ilahin nas.', 'Say: I seek refuge in the Lord of people, the King of people, the God of people, from the whispering devil who withdraws.', 'کہو: میں لوگوں کے رب، لوگوں کے بادشاہ، لوگوں کے معبود کی پناہ مانگتا ہوں، اس وسوسے سے جو پیچھے ہٹ جاتا ہے۔', null, null, 'Quran 114:1-6. Arabic, Saheeh International English, and Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry Urdu were copied from api.alquran.cloud on 2026-10-20. Compare them with a printed mushaf before approval. The basmala at the start is included because that API edition returns it with the first ayah.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, null, 3, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
