values ('waking-1', 'azkar', 'waking', 'Thanks on waking', 'ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّٰهِ ٱلَّذِي أَحْيَانَا بَعْدَ مَا أَمَاتَنَا وَإِلَيْهِ ٱلنُّشُورُ', 'Alhamdu lillahil ladhi ahyana ba''da ma amatana wa ilayhin nushur.', 'Praise belongs to Allah, who gave us life after causing us to die, and to Him is the return.', 'تعریف اللہ کے لیے ہے جس نے ہمیں موت کے بعد زندگی دی، اور اسی کی طرف اٹھنا ہے۔', null, null, 'Draft wording for a parent or teacher to compare with a trusted book. Not marked verified. Reported in Sahih al-Bukhari when waking from sleep. Confirm the number and the Arabic.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, null, 1, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
