values ('waking-2', 'azkar', 'waking', 'Beginning the day with Allah''s name', 'بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ', 'Bismillahir rahmanir rahim.', 'In the name of Allah, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.', 'شروع اللہ کا نام لے کر جو بڑا مہربان نہایت رحم والا ہے۔', null, null, 'Quran 1:1 as returned by api.alquran.cloud. Arabic, Saheeh International English, and Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry Urdu were copied from api.alquran.cloud on 2026-10-20. Compare them with a printed mushaf before approval. Saying it on waking is a family practice; it is not by itself a separate waking hadith.', 'needs_review', false, 3, 10, null, 1, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
