values ('sleeping-1', 'azkar', 'sleeping', 'Before closing the eyes', 'بِٱسْمِكَ ٱللَّٰهُمَّ أَمُوتُ وَأَحْيَا', 'Bismika Allahumma amutu wa ahya.', 'In Your name, O Allah, I die and I live.', 'اے اللہ، تیرے نام کے ساتھ میں مرتا ہوں اور جیتا ہوں۔', null, null, 'Draft wording for a parent or teacher to compare with a trusted book. Not marked verified. Reported in Sahih al-Bukhari for going to sleep. Confirm the number. The words "die and live" here mean sleep and waking, in a gentle sense for children.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, null, 1, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
