values ('after-prayer-1', 'azkar', 'after-prayer', 'Asking forgiveness after prayer', 'أَسْتَغْفِرُ ٱللَّٰهَ', 'Astaghfirullah.', 'I ask Allah to forgive me. Many families say this three times after the prayer. Confirm that count with your teacher.', 'میں اللہ سے معافی مانگتا ہوں۔ بہت سے گھر نماز کے بعد یہ تین بار کہتے ہیں۔ تعداد اپنے استاد سے پوچھ لیں۔', null, null, 'Draft wording for a parent or teacher to compare with a trusted book. Not marked verified. The three-times practice is widely taught from hadith. Confirm the wording and the count.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, null, 3, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
