values ('after-prayer-3', 'azkar', 'after-prayer', 'After-prayer praise, thirty-three', 'سُبْحَانَ ٱللَّٰهِ', 'Subhana Allah.', 'Allah is free from every flaw. The well-known practice is thirty-three times after prayer. Confirm it before teaching the count as fixed.', 'اللہ ہر نقص سے پاک ہے۔ نماز کے بعد مشہور عمل تینتیس بار ہے۔ تعداد کو ثابت ماننے سے پہلے حوالہ دیکھ لیں۔', null, null, 'Draft wording for a parent or teacher to compare with a trusted book. Not marked verified. Part of the after-prayer dhikr in Sahih Muslim. This item is only the first phrase, not the whole report.', 'needs_review', false, 6, 10, null, 33, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
