values ('after-prayer-4', 'azkar', 'after-prayer', 'After-prayer thanks, thirty-three', 'ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّٰهِ', 'Al-hamdu lillah.', 'All praise belongs to Allah. Commonly thirty-three times after the previous phrase.', 'تمام تعریف اللہ کے لیے ہے۔ عام طور پر پچھلے ذکر کے بعد تینتیس بار۔', null, null, 'Draft wording for a parent or teacher to compare with a trusted book. Not marked verified. Part of the same after-prayer report. Confirm the order and the final count in your edition.', 'needs_review', false, 6, 10, null, 33, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
