values ('after-prayer-7', 'azkar', 'after-prayer', 'Surah Al-Ikhlas after prayer', 'بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ
ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ
لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ
وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ', 'Qul huwallahu ahad.', 'Read Surah Al-Ikhlas after prayer while learning it.', 'نماز کے بعد سیکھنے کے لیے سورۃ اخلاص پڑھیں۔', null, null, 'Quran 112:1-4. Arabic, Saheeh International English, and Fateh Muhammad Jalandhry Urdu were copied from api.alquran.cloud on 2026-10-20. Compare them with a printed mushaf before approval. The basmala at the start is included because that API edition returns it with the first ayah. Do not add a special reward for this placement until a hadith is checked.', 'needs_review', false, 6, 10, null, 1, null, '{"lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
