values ('quiz-9', 'quiz', 'kalimas', 'Turning away', '', '', 'The sixth kalima says a person turns away from what?', 'چھٹا کلمہ کس چیز سے بیزاری بتاتا ہے؟', 'It rejects kufr and shirk. A teacher should explain those words gently.', 'یہ کفر اور شرک سے بیزاری ہے۔ استاد یہ الفاظ نرمی سے سمجھائیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Kindness","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Disbelief and associating partners with Allah","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Sharing food","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Saying salam","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"It rejects kufr and shirk. A teacher should explain those words gently.","explanationUr":"یہ کفر اور شرک سے بیزاری ہے۔ استاد یہ الفاظ نرمی سے سمجھائیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
