values ('quiz-10', 'quiz', 'kalimas', 'How many', '', '', 'How many kalimas are in this children''s set?', 'بچوں کے اس سیٹ میں کتنے کلمے ہیں؟', 'This textbook set has six kalimas. That count is a school set, not a verse.', 'یہ نصابی سیٹ چھ کلمے ہیں۔ یہ تعداد کسی آیت کا نمبر نہیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Three","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Five","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Six","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Ten","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"This textbook set has six kalimas. That count is a school set, not a verse.","explanationUr":"یہ نصابی سیٹ چھ کلمے ہیں۔ یہ تعداد کسی آیت کا نمبر نہیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
