values ('quiz-14', 'quiz', 'manners', 'Parents', '', '', 'How should a child speak to parents?', 'بچے کو ماں باپ سے کیسی بات کرنی چاہیے؟', 'Quran 17:23 tells us not to say "uff" to parents and to speak kindly. The Arabic was fetched for the lessons file.', 'سورۃ الاسراء 23 میں ماں باپ کو اف نہ کہنے اور اچھی بات کرنے کا حکم ہے۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"With kind words","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"With shouting","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"With \"uff\"","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"By walking away","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 17:23 tells us not to say \"uff\" to parents and to speak kindly. The Arabic was fetched for the lessons file.","explanationUr":"سورۃ الاسراء 23 میں ماں باپ کو اف نہ کہنے اور اچھی بات کرنے کا حکم ہے۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
