values ('quiz-16', 'quiz', 'manners', 'Names', '', '', 'What should we avoid calling a friend?', 'دوست کو کیا نہیں کہنا چاہیے؟', 'Name-calling hurts. Allah forbids mocking people in Quran 49:11. Confirm that verse.', 'برے نام دکھ دیتے ہیں۔ سورۃ الحجرات 11 میں مذاق سے منع ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"A hurtful name","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Their real name","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Salam","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Please","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Name-calling hurts. Allah forbids mocking people in Quran 49:11. Confirm that verse.","explanationUr":"برے نام دکھ دیتے ہیں۔ سورۃ الحجرات 11 میں مذاق سے منع ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
