values ('quiz-25', 'quiz', 'manners', 'Guests', '', '', 'A guest comes to your home. What is kind?', 'مہمان گھر آئے۔ مہربانی کیا ہے؟', 'Honoring a guest is a Muslim manner. Confirm any hadith before quoting one.', 'مہمان کی عزت مسلمانوں کا ادب ہے۔ حدیث نقل کرنے سے پہلے اسے چیک کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Smile and make space","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Hide the chairs","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Frown","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Ignore them","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Honoring a guest is a Muslim manner. Confirm any hadith before quoting one.","explanationUr":"مہمان کی عزت مسلمانوں کا ادب ہے۔ حدیث نقل کرنے سے پہلے اسے چیک کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
