values ('quiz-34', 'quiz', 'prayer', 'Face', '', '', 'In the wudu verse, what is washed first among these?', 'وضو کی آیت میں ان میں سے پہلے کیا دھویا جاتا ہے؟', 'Quran 5:6 says to wash the faces. The fetched Arabic is in the lessons file.', 'سورۃ المائدہ 6 میں منہ دھونے کا ذکر ہے۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The face","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"The shoes only","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"The hair dye","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"The belt","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 5:6 says to wash the faces. The fetched Arabic is in the lessons file.","explanationUr":"سورۃ المائدہ 6 میں منہ دھونے کا ذکر ہے۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
