values ('quiz-37', 'quiz', 'prayer', 'Feet', '', '', 'In that verse, the feet are washed to where?', 'اس آیت میں پاؤں کہاں تک دھوئے جاتے ہیں؟', 'Quran 5:6 says to the ankles. Families may teach extra sunnah steps; ask a parent.', 'سورۃ المائدہ 6 میں ٹخنوں تک کا ذکر ہے۔ اضافی سنتیں والدین سے پوچھیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The ankles","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"The knees only","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"The hips","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"They are skipped","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 5:6 says to the ankles. Families may teach extra sunnah steps; ask a parent.","explanationUr":"سورۃ المائدہ 6 میں ٹخنوں تک کا ذکر ہے۔ اضافی سنتیں والدین سے پوچھیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
