values ('quiz-41', 'quiz', 'basic-knowledge', 'Pillars', '', '', 'How many pillars of Islam are in the famous hadith?', 'مشہور حدیث میں اسلام کے کتنے ستون ہیں؟', 'The hadith "Islam is built upon five" is in Sahih al-Bukhari and Sahih Muslim. Confirm the number in your edition.', 'حدیث "اسلام کی بنیاد پانچ پر ہے" بخاری اور مسلم میں ہے۔ اپنے نسخے میں نمبر دیکھیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Three","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Four","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Five","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Seven","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The hadith \"Islam is built upon five\" is in Sahih al-Bukhari and Sahih Muslim. Confirm the number in your edition.","explanationUr":"حدیث \"اسلام کی بنیاد پانچ پر ہے\" بخاری اور مسلم میں ہے۔ اپنے نسخے میں نمبر دیکھیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
