values ('quiz-49', 'quiz', 'basic-knowledge', 'Makkah', '', '', 'In which city was Prophet Muhammad born?', 'نبی محمد کس شہر میں پیدا ہوئے؟', 'He was born in Makkah. This is standard seerah; a reviewer should name the book they trust.', 'آپ مکہ میں پیدا ہوئے۔ یہ سیرت کی مشہور بات ہے؛ معتبر کتاب کا نام لکھیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Makkah","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Madinah","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Jerusalem","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Taif only","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"He was born in Makkah. This is standard seerah; a reviewer should name the book they trust.","explanationUr":"آپ مکہ میں پیدا ہوئے۔ یہ سیرت کی مشہور بات ہے؛ معتبر کتاب کا نام لکھیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
