values ('quiz-51', 'quiz', 'basic-knowledge', 'Mercy', '', '', 'A Muslim calls Prophet Muhammad a mercy for whom?', 'مسلمان نبی محمد کو کس کے لیے رحمت کہتے ہیں؟', 'Quran 21:107 calls him a mercy to the worlds. Confirm the verse before approval.', 'سورۃ الانبیاء 107 میں انہیں عالموں کے لیے رحمت کہا گیا ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The worlds","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Only one family","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Only rich people","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"No one","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 21:107 calls him a mercy to the worlds. Confirm the verse before approval.","explanationUr":"سورۃ الانبیاء 107 میں انہیں عالموں کے لیے رحمت کہا گیا ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
