values ('quiz-52', 'quiz', 'basic-knowledge', 'Clean', '', '', 'Before holding a mushaf, a careful child does what?', 'مصحف اٹھانے سے پہلے احتیاط کیا ہے؟', 'We respect the mushaf. Ask a parent about the exact purity rule your family follows.', 'ہم مصحف کی عزت کرتے ہیں۔ طہارت کا قاعدہ اپنے گھر سے پوچھیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Has clean hands and follows the family''s wudu practice","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Eats over it","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Drags it on the floor","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Draws on the page","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"We respect the mushaf. Ask a parent about the exact purity rule your family follows.","explanationUr":"ہم مصحف کی عزت کرتے ہیں۔ طہارت کا قاعدہ اپنے گھر سے پوچھیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
