values ('quiz-56', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'First', '', '', 'Who is remembered as the first prophet?', 'پہلے نبی کے طور پر کسے یاد کیا جاتا ہے؟', 'Adam is the first prophet in Islamic teaching. Confirm the child-level source you prefer.', 'اسلامی تعلیم میں آدم پہلے نبی ہیں۔ بچوں والی کتاب کی تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Adam","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Muhammad","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Isa","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Yusuf","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Adam is the first prophet in Islamic teaching. Confirm the child-level source you prefer.","explanationUr":"اسلامی تعلیم میں آدم پہلے نبی ہیں۔ بچوں والی کتاب کی تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
