values ('quiz-57', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Ark', '', '', 'Which prophet built the ark?', 'کشتی کس نبی نے بنائی؟', 'The Quran tells the story of Nuh and the ship. See Surah Nuh and Surah Hud.', 'قرآن نوح اور کشتی کا قصہ بیان کرتا ہے۔ سورۃ نوح اور سورۃ ہود دیکھیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Nuh","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Yunus","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Lut","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Hud","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The Quran tells the story of Nuh and the ship. See Surah Nuh and Surah Hud.","explanationUr":"قرآن نوح اور کشتی کا قصہ بیان کرتا ہے۔ سورۃ نوح اور سورۃ ہود دیکھیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
