values ('quiz-58', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Friend', '', '', 'Which prophet is known as Khalilullah, the close friend of Allah?', 'اللہ کے خلیل کس نبی کو کہا جاتا ہے؟', 'Ibrahim is called Allah''s close friend in Quran 4:125. Confirm the verse.', 'سورۃ النساء 125 میں ابراہیم کو خلیل کہا گیا ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ibrahim","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Yunus","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Sulayman","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Dawud","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Ibrahim is called Allah''s close friend in Quran 4:125. Confirm the verse.","explanationUr":"سورۃ النساء 125 میں ابراہیم کو خلیل کہا گیا ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
