values ('quiz-59', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'House', '', '', 'Who raised the foundations of the Kaaba with Ismail?', 'اسماعیل کے ساتھ کعبہ کی بنیاد کس نے اٹھائی؟', 'Quran 2:127. The Arabic was fetched into the stories file.', 'سورۃ البقرہ 127۔ عربی کہانیوں والی فائل میں ہے۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Ibrahim","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Yusuf","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"A later king","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Nuh","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 2:127. The Arabic was fetched into the stories file.","explanationUr":"سورۃ البقرہ 127۔ عربی کہانیوں والی فائل میں ہے۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
