values ('quiz-61', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Baby', '', '', 'Which prophet was placed in the river as a baby?', 'کس نبی کو بچپن میں دریا میں رکھا گیا؟', 'The Quran tells this in Surah Ta-Ha and Surah Al-Qasas.', 'قرآن یہ قصہ سورۃ طٰہٰ اور سورۃ القصص میں بیان کرتا ہے۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Musa","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Isa","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Yunus","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Ibrahim","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The Quran tells this in Surah Ta-Ha and Surah Al-Qasas.","explanationUr":"قرآن یہ قصہ سورۃ طٰہٰ اور سورۃ القصص میں بیان کرتا ہے۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
