values ('quiz-62', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Staff', '', '', 'Which prophet''s staff is part of his story with Pharaoh?', 'فرعون والے قصے میں عصا کس نبی کا ہے؟', 'Musa''s signs before Pharaoh are in the Quran. Avoid scary details with little children.', 'موسیٰ کی نشانیاں قرآن میں ہیں۔ چھوٹے بچوں کو ڈراؤنی تفصیل نہ دیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Musa","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Yusuf","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Nuh","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Lut","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Musa''s signs before Pharaoh are in the Quran. Avoid scary details with little children.","explanationUr":"موسیٰ کی نشانیاں قرآن میں ہیں۔ چھوٹے بچوں کو ڈراؤنی تفصیل نہ دیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
