values ('quiz-63', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Teacher', '', '', 'In Surah Al-Kahf, Musa travels to learn from whom?', 'سورۃ کہف میں موسیٰ کس سے سیکھنے جاتے ہیں؟', 'The Quran describes a teacher without using the later name in the verses themselves. Do not add a name until you decide how to teach it.', 'قرآن اس استاد کا ذکر کرتا ہے۔ بچوں کو نام بعد کی کتابوں سے دینے سے پہلے فیصلہ کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"A servant of Allah whom the surah does not name in the child''s text","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Pharaoh","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"A merchant only","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A poet","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The Quran describes a teacher without using the later name in the verses themselves. Do not add a name until you decide how to teach it.","explanationUr":"قرآن اس استاد کا ذکر کرتا ہے۔ بچوں کو نام بعد کی کتابوں سے دینے سے پہلے فیصلہ کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
