values ('quiz-64', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Psalms', '', '', 'Which prophet was given the Zabur?', 'زبور کس نبی کو دیا گیا؟', 'Quran 17:55 mentions the Zabur given to Dawud. Confirm the verse.', 'سورۃ الاسراء 55 میں داؤد کو زبور دیے جانے کا ذکر ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Dawud","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Yusuf","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Hud","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Salih","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quran 17:55 mentions the Zabur given to Dawud. Confirm the verse.","explanationUr":"سورۃ الاسراء 55 میں داؤد کو زبور دیے جانے کا ذکر ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
