values ('quiz-69', 'quiz', 'prophets', 'Last', '', '', 'Who is the last prophet?', 'آخری نبی کون ہیں؟', 'Muslims believe Muhammad is the final messenger. Quran 33:40 calls him the seal of the prophets. Confirm the verse.', 'مسلمان محمد کو آخری رسول مانتے ہیں۔ سورۃ الاحزاب 40 میں خاتم النبیین ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Muhammad","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Isa","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Musa","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Ibrahim","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Muslims believe Muhammad is the final messenger. Quran 33:40 calls him the seal of the prophets. Confirm the verse.","explanationUr":"مسلمان محمد کو آخری رسول مانتے ہیں۔ سورۃ الاحزاب 40 میں خاتم النبیین ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
