values ('quiz-83', 'quiz', 'quran', 'Juz', '', '', 'A mushaf is often divided into how many juz for reading?', 'پڑھنے کے لیے مصحف اکثر کتنے پاروں میں بٹا ہوتا ہے؟', 'Thirty juz is the common division. A reviewer should confirm this teaching point.', 'تیس پارے عام تقسیم ہے۔ اس نکتے کی تصدیق کریں۔', 'Count or name from the standard written mushaf. A reviewer should confirm it against a printed copy.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"30","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"7","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"114","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"5","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Thirty juz is the common division. A reviewer should confirm this teaching point.","explanationUr":"تیس پارے عام تقسیم ہے۔ اس نکتے کی تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
