values ('quiz-84', 'quiz', 'quran', 'Listening', '', '', 'When the Quran is recited, a polite listener does what?', 'قرآن کی تلاوت ہو تو شائستہ سننے والا کیا کرتا ہے؟', 'Quiet listening is respect. Quran 7:204 mentions listening when the Quran is recited. Confirm it.', 'خاموش سننا عزت ہے۔ سورۃ الاعراف 204 میں سننے کا ذکر ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Count or name from the standard written mushaf. A reviewer should confirm it against a printed copy.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Listens quietly","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Talks over it","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Plays a loud game","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"Mocks a mistake","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Quiet listening is respect. Quran 7:204 mentions listening when the Quran is recited. Confirm it.","explanationUr":"خاموش سننا عزت ہے۔ سورۃ الاعراف 204 میں سننے کا ذکر ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
