values ('quiz-88', 'quiz', 'history', 'Helper', '', '', 'Who supported the Prophet first in his own home?', 'گھر میں نبی کا ساتھ سب سے پہلے کس نے دیا؟', 'Khadijah''s support is standard seerah. Confirm the book.', 'خدیجہ کا ساتھ مشہور سیرت ہے۔ کتاب کی تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Khadijah","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"A stranger from another faith who mocked him","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Pharaoh","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A poet who sold poems","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Khadijah''s support is standard seerah. Confirm the book.","explanationUr":"خدیجہ کا ساتھ مشہور سیرت ہے۔ کتاب کی تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
