values ('quiz-89', 'quiz', 'history', 'Cave trip', '', '', 'On the journey to Madinah, the Prophet hid with his companion in which cave?', 'مدینہ کے سفر میں نبی اپنے ساتھی کے ساتھ کس غار میں چھپے؟', 'The cave of Thawr is standard seerah. Quran 9:40 is read with this story. Confirm it.', 'غارِ ثور مشہور سیرت ہے۔ اس قصے کے ساتھ سورۃ التوبہ 40 پڑھی جاتی ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Thawr","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"Hira again for a year","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"A cave in China","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"No cave is mentioned in seerah","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The cave of Thawr is standard seerah. Quran 9:40 is read with this story. Confirm it.","explanationUr":"غارِ ثور مشہور سیرت ہے۔ اس قصے کے ساتھ سورۃ التوبہ 40 پڑھی جاتی ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
