values ('quiz-92', 'quiz', 'history', 'Qibla change', '', '', 'Muslims first faced another mosque, then turned toward where?', 'پہلے رخ ایک مسجد کی طرف تھا، پھر کہاں ہو گیا؟', 'The change of qibla is in Quran 2:144. Confirm the verse.', 'قبلے کا بدلنا سورۃ البقرہ 144 میں ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Kaaba in Makkah","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"A palace","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"The sea only","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A mountain in Yemen only","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The change of qibla is in Quran 2:144. Confirm the verse.","explanationUr":"قبلے کا بدلنا سورۃ البقرہ 144 میں ہے۔ تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
