values ('quiz-93', 'quiz', 'history', 'Treaty', '', '', 'The peaceful agreement at Hudaybiyyah is remembered as what?', 'حدیبیہ کے معاہدے کو کیا یاد کیا جاتا ہے؟', 'Hudaybiyyah was a treaty. Teach it simply, without battle details, for ages 7–10.', 'حدیبیہ ایک معاہدہ تھا۔ 7 سے 10 سال کے بچوں کو بغیر لڑائی کی تفصیل کے سنائیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"A treaty","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"A children''s game","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"A poem contest only","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A sea battle","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"Hudaybiyyah was a treaty. Teach it simply, without battle details, for ages 7–10.","explanationUr":"حدیبیہ ایک معاہدہ تھا۔ 7 سے 10 سال کے بچوں کو بغیر لڑائی کی تفصیل کے سنائیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
