values ('quiz-94', 'quiz', 'history', 'Opening', '', '', 'Makkah was later opened in a way our lessons describe as what?', 'بعد میں مکہ کو ہماری سبق میں کیسے یاد کریں؟', 'The opening of Makkah needs a parent''s wording. This quiz does not tell battle details.', 'فتحِ مکہ والدین کے الفاظ سے سنی جائے۔ اس سوال میں لڑائی کی تفصیل نہیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"With a conquest that a parent should explain gently","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"With a magic spell","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"With a flood","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"It never opened","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The opening of Makkah needs a parent''s wording. This quiz does not tell battle details.","explanationUr":"فتحِ مکہ والدین کے الفاظ سے سنی جائے۔ اس سوال میں لڑائی کی تفصیل نہیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
