values ('quiz-95', 'quiz', 'history', 'Farewell', '', '', 'Near the end of his life, the Prophet gave which famous sermon?', 'زندگی کے آخر میں نبی نے کون سا مشہور خطبہ دیا؟', 'The Farewell Sermon is standard seerah. Quote it only from a checked text.', 'حجۃ الوداع کا خطبہ مشہور سیرت ہے۔ اقتباس صرف چیک شدہ متن سے لیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Farewell Sermon","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"A sermon in Rome","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"A children''s play","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"No sermon","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The Farewell Sermon is standard seerah. Quote it only from a checked text.","explanationUr":"حجۃ الوداع کا خطبہ مشہور سیرت ہے۔ اقتباس صرف چیک شدہ متن سے لیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
