values ('quiz-96', 'quiz', 'history', 'Calendar', '', '', 'The Islamic year count begins from what?', 'اسلامی سال کی گنتی کس سے شروع ہوتی ہے؟', 'The Hijri calendar starts from the Hijrah. Confirm the historical note.', 'ہجری کیلنڈر ہجرت سے شروع ہوتا ہے۔ تاریخی نوٹ کی تصدیق کریں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 7, 10, 'growing', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Hijrah","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"The birth of Isa","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"The building of a palace in Spain","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A king''s birthday","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"The Hijri calendar starts from the Hijrah. Confirm the historical note.","explanationUr":"ہجری کیلنڈر ہجرت سے شروع ہوتا ہے۔ تاریخی نوٹ کی تصدیق کریں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
