values ('quiz-98', 'quiz', 'history', 'Respect', '', '', 'When we say the Prophet''s name, a Muslim home often adds what?', 'نبی کا نام لیں تو مسلمان گھر میں اکثر کیا کہتے ہیں؟', 'We say peace be upon him. Teach the short Arabic only after a parent is happy with the pronunciation.', 'ہم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم کہتے ہیں۔ مختصر عربی تلفظ والدین کی رضامندی کے بعد سکھائیں۔', 'Basic Islamic teaching for children. A reviewer should attach the exact Quran or hadith reference before this is called verified.', 'needs_review', false, 5, 10, 'easy', null, null, '{"options":[{"id":"a","text":"A prayer of peace upon him","icon":"sun","imageUrl":null},{"id":"b","text":"A joke","icon":"heart","imageUrl":null},{"id":"c","text":"Nothing unkind only, with no prayer ever","icon":"star","imageUrl":null},{"id":"d","text":"A nickname","icon":"cloud","imageUrl":null}],"explanation":"We say peace be upon him. Teach the short Arabic only after a parent is happy with the pronunciation.","explanationUr":"ہم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم کہتے ہیں۔ مختصر عربی تلفظ والدین کی رضامندی کے بعد سکھائیں۔","lessonLearned":null}'::jsonb)
